  "id": "v20",
  "subject": "feat(hybrid): L2C MMIO config restore/drain via the Program Buffer (ABI v5)",
  "body_points": [
    "restore_l2c writes only the boot-static config registers (Control, HPM, way masks) via PB sw stores per DS220 11.8.3; drain_l2c lwu re-reads them for verify; HARD-gated on Simulator::l2c_present() (_NDS_L2C_CACHE_SIZE_KB > 0) because a store to an absent L2C faults the PB",
    "ABI pinned at v5"
  ],
  "construct": "Re-pin v5. program_buffer word-store/load helpers (if deferred from v04), resume_driver/state_drain/handoff_controller/simulator L2C parts (final), state_abi.test.cpp v5 section, program_buffer/resume/drain test cases. Reference: d059ca1, 128a03a.",
  "validate": [
    "compile+run the affected tests against SCRATCH/abi/v5"
  ]
}

